    "title": "Ocarina of Time",
    "description": "A 3D animated scene featuring Link playing the Ocarina of Time at Hyrule Castle. This wallpaper features an interactive Ocarina that you can play yourself, making different characters appear or events occur.\n\nThe wallpaper can recognize all of the official songs from Ocarina of Time and Majora's Mask. There are a few additional objects in the scene that can be clicked on. There are also settings related to the color of Link's tunic, Navi's color, and other camera and audio settings.\n\nLink can also play songs automatically, either by clicking the \"?\" button on the interface or by waiting for a while without clicking the desktop. Use the \"Look at Events\" camera option if you want the scene to be fully automatic or use the \"Manual\" camera option to control the camera yourself by clicking and dragging the mouse.\n\nResource rippers:\nMasterPengo | BrittanyOfKoppai | Guy | KleinStudio | PwnzLPs | SuprRooster | Irastris | Twilight Weaver | JerseyXS97 | MidnightXS | Hallow | Centrixe the Dodo | Kairamen | Fallen Star | Cooper | Random Talking Bush | Chaofanatic | plotlineplus | xAct | manpaint55 | supersmashball | alecpike | ColbyFoxCat",
